    "The chip model is KiCad's stock SC-59: nominal sizes, no part marking, no solder, not CAD of the 2SK208 to be bought. Its plastic is 3.0 x 1.6 mm; the Toshiba drawing allows up to 3.1 x 1.75 mm, which is why fit-check.json reads tighter.",
